{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1562","original":"A Japanese [[VOCALOID]] developed and distributed by Crypton Future Media, Inc., and was originally released for the VOCALOID2 engine on December 27, 2007. She is the second of the Character Vocal Series together with [[Kagamine Len]] and is an official [[Piapro Studio|PIAPRO]] character.\r\n\r\nShe has [[blonde hair]] done in a short hair style and [[blue eyes]]. She wears a [[sailor collar]] shirt with [[treble clef]] print. She wears [[shorts]] along with [[detached sleeves]], [[leg warmers]] and a large [[white bow|white]] [[hair bow]] connected on a white [[headset]], and [[parallel hairclips]].\r\n\r\nHer counterpart is [[Kagamine Len]]. Their relationship (whether they are [[siblings]], lovers, etc) is officially left ambiguous and left up to the user to decide.\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Shimoda Asami]]. She was originally designed and illustrated by [[KEI (Keigarou)|]] for her V2 voicebank. Her V4X voicebank follows a similar outfit with readjustments designed and illustrated by [[iXima]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #164844: VOCALOID2 [[kagamine rin (act1)|Act1]]\r\n* !post #4921833: VOCALOID2 Act2\r\n* !post #804549: [[Kagamine Rin (Append)|Append]]\r\n* !post #2534193: [[Kagamine Rin (Vocaloid4)|Vocaloid4]]\r\n* !post #7936744: [[Kagamine Rin (SP)|SUPER PACK]]\r\n* !post #9885325: [[Kagamine Rin (NT)|NT]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Magical Mirai Rin]]\r\n* [[Sakura Rin]]\r\n* [[Yuki Rin]]\r\n* [[Kagamine Rin  (voicebank)]]\r\n* [[List of VOCALOID derivatives]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official page\":https://ec.crypton.co.jp/pages/prod/virtualsinger/cv02","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"kagamine_rin"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:390427","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":390427},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:kagamine_rin","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:44:00.604069+00:00","name":"kagamine_rin","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:5809","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"wiki_tag_link","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":390427,"tag_key":{"kind":"tag","namespace":"danbooru.tag","value":"kagamine_rin"},"wiki_id":5809,"wiki_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"5809"}},{"body_sha256":"e447e36a0cf934cbcea1e51165d3a30220adc86fdc5e9f64db80f5bca5386c70","evidence_id":"wiki-cut:5809","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","live_body_sha256":"e447e36a0cf934cbcea1e51165d3a30220adc86fdc5e9f64db80f5bca5386c70","live_other_names_sha256":"57bce5c3c277c99e9ef385c84361f6c2dd70173fff298f84652c217a7b2af14a","live_updated_at":"2026-08-29T22:03:28.219-04:00","old_body_sha256":"e447e36a0cf934cbcea1e51165d3a30220adc86fdc5e9f64db80f5bca5386c70","old_evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1562","old_input_sha256":"a2